Package: attrition
Title: Standardized Turnover Metrics for padm-Conforming Workforce Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("paVerse", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Turnover rate under multiple, explicitly-named denominator
    definitions (exposure, average headcount, beginning headcount), rolling
    rates, and Kaplan-Meier retention curves and cohort tables built on
    padm-conforming pa_assignment and tenure data. Every function documents
    its numerator and denominator so a reported rate is never ambiguous
    about what it measures.
